<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Exercices Python — Seconde</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap');

:root {
  --bg: #f5f4f0;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --surface2: #f0eeea;
  --border: #ddd9d0;
  --text: #1a1814;
  --text-muted: #7a746a;
  --accent: #5b4fcf;
  --accent-bg: #efedfc;
  --green: #1a7a4a;
  --green-bg: #e6f5ed;
  --orange: #b85c00;
  --orange-bg: #fff3e0;
  --blue: #0f5fa8;
  --blue-bg: #e8f0fc;
  --red: #b52020;
  --red-bg: #fdeaea;
  --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  --sans: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
  --radius: 14px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  min-height: 100vh;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ── HEADER ── */
.site-header {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 40px 32px 36px;
}

.site-header-inner {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  opacity: 0.7;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.site-header h1 {
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.site-header p {
  opacity: 0.85;
  max-width: 480px;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.progress-wrap {
  margin-top: 24px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}

.progress-track {
  flex: 1;
  height: 8px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  border-radius: 999px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 999px;
  transition: width 0.4s ease;
  width: 0%;
}

.progress-txt {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  opacity: 0.8;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ── FILTERS ── */
.filters {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 20px 32px 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.pill {
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-weight: 600;
  border: 2px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}

.pill:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
.pill.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

/* ── MAIN ── */
main {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 24px 32px 80px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20px;
}

/* ── CARD ── */
.card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 2px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}

.card.done { border-color: #1a7a4a; }

.card-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 18px 22px;
  cursor: pointer;
  user-select: none;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}

.card-header:hover { background: var(--surface2); }

.card.open .card-header {
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
}

.card-num {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  background: var(--accent-bg);
  color: var(--accent);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.card.done .card-num {
  background: var(--green-bg);
  color: var(--green);
}

.card-title-block { flex: 1; }

.card-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.card-tags {
  display: flex;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 3px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.tag {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.tag-fonction { background: var(--accent-bg); color: var(--accent); }
.tag-for      { background: var(--blue-bg);   color: var(--blue); }
.tag-while    { background: var(--orange-bg);  color: var(--orange); }
.tag-liste    { background: var(--red-bg);     color: var(--red); }
.tag-new      { background: #fff3cd; color: #7a5c00; }

.card-chevron {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 18px;
  transition: transform 0.2s;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.card.open .card-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }

/* ── CARD BODY ── */
.card-body {
  display: none;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}

.card.open .card-body { display: flex; }

/* ── COURSE BLOCK ── */
.course-block {
  background: #fffbf0;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #ffe082;
  padding: 18px 22px;
}

.course-block .section-label {
  color: #7a5c00;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

.course-text {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: #3a2f00;
}

.course-text p + p { margin-top: 8px; }

.course-text code {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  background: #fff3cd;
  border: 1px solid #ffe082;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 1px 6px;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  color: #7a4f00;
}

.course-text strong { font-weight: 700; }

/* ── EXO CONTENT ── */
.exo-content {
  padding: 20px 22px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
}

.section-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.consigne {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.consigne strong { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }
.consigne em { font-style: italic; color: var(--text-muted); }

.consigne code {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  background: var(--accent-bg);
  border: 1px solid #ccc8f0;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 1px 6px;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  color: var(--accent);
}

/* ── EXPECTED ── */
.expected-box {
  background: var(--surface2);
  border: 2px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 14px 16px;
}

.expected-box .section-label { color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 6px; }

/* ── CODE PRE ── */
pre {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.85;
  background: #1e1e2e;
  color: #cdd6f4;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.expected-box pre {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
}

/* Syntax colors */
.kw  { color: #cba6f7; }
.fn  { color: #89b4fa; }
.str { color: #a6e3a1; }
.num { color: #fab387; }
.cm  { color: #6c7086; font-style: italic; }
.op  { color: #89dceb; }
.bi  { color: #f9e2af; }
.ret { color: #f38ba8; }

/* ── ACCORDIONS ── */
.accordion-wrap {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--border);
}

.accordion {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.accordion:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.accordion-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 14px 22px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: background 0.15s;
  user-select: none;
}

.accordion-header:hover { background: var(--surface2); }

.accordion.hint .accordion-header { color: var(--orange); }
.accordion.correction .accordion-header { color: var(--green); }

.accordion-icon { transition: transform 0.2s; }
.accordion.open .accordion-icon { transform: rotate(180deg); }

.accordion-body {
  display: none;
  padding: 0 22px 20px;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
  background: var(--surface2);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding-top: 16px;
}

.accordion.open .accordion-body { display: flex; }

/* hint steps */
.hint-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}

.hint-step {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.hint-step-num {
  background: var(--orange-bg);
  color: var(--orange);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 1px;
}

.hint-step code {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 1px 5px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--accent);
}

/* ── DONE BTN ── */
.card-footer {
  padding: 16px 22px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
}

.done-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 9px 20px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 2px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}

.done-btn:hover { border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green); background: var(--green-bg); }

.card.done .done-btn {
  background: var(--green-bg);
  border-color: var(--green);
  color: var(--green);
}

/* ── MOBILE ── */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .site-header, .filters, main { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
  .card-header, .exo-content, .accordion-header { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="site-header-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">// Informatique · Classe de Seconde</div>
    <h1>Exercices Python 🐍</h1>
    <p>10 exercices progressifs — variables, fonctions, boucles. Chaque exercice inclut un mini cours, des indices et une correction.</p>
    <div class="progress-wrap">
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressBar"></div></div>
      <div class="progress-txt" id="progressTxt">0 / 10</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="filters">
  <button class="pill active" onclick="filter('all',this)">Tous</button>
  <button class="pill" onclick="filter('fonction',this)">Fonctions</button>
  <button class="pill" onclick="filter('for',this)">Boucle for</button>
  <button class="pill" onclick="filter('while',this)">Boucle while</button>
  <button class="pill" onclick="filter('liste',this)">Listes</button>
</div>

<main>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
     EXO 1 — print et variables
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="card" id="c1" data-tags="fonction">
  <div class="card-header" onclick="toggle('c1')">
    <div class="card-num" id="num1">01</div>
    <div class="card-title-block">
      <div class="card-title">Mon premier affichage</div>
      <div class="card-tags">
        <span class="tag tag-fonction">variables</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="card-chevron">▾</span>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">

    <div class="course-block">
      <div class="section-label">📖 Ce qu'il faut savoir</div>
      <div class="course-text">
        <p>En Python, <code>print(...)</code> affiche quelque chose à l'écran. C'est la première chose que tout programmeur apprend.</p>
        <p>On peut stocker une valeur dans une <strong>variable</strong> et l'afficher ensuite. Une variable, c'est comme une boîte avec un nom.</p>
        <p>Exemple : <code>age = 16</code> crée une variable qui s'appelle <code>age</code> et qui contient la valeur <code>16</code>.</p>
        <p>Pour afficher plusieurs choses d'un coup : <code>print("J'ai", age, "ans")</code></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exo-content">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">Énoncé</div>
        <p class="consigne">
          Crée trois variables : <strong>prenom</strong> (ton prénom), <strong>age</strong> (ton âge), <strong>classe</strong> (ta classe).
          <br><br>
          Affiche ensuite une phrase complète, par exemple :<br>
          <em>"Bonjour, je m'appelle Alice, j'ai 15 ans et je suis en Seconde."</em>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="expected-box">
        <div class="section-label">Exemple de sortie</div>
        <pre>Bonjour, je m'appelle Alice, j'ai 15 ans et je suis en Seconde.</pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-wrap">
      <div class="accordion hint" id="h1">
        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAcc('h1')">
          💡 Indices <span class="accordion-icon">▾</span>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <div class="hint-list">
            <div class="hint-step">
              <span class="hint-step-num">1</span>
              <span>Crée les variables : <code>prenom = "Alice"</code>, <code>age = 15</code>, <code>classe = "Seconde"</code></span>
            </div>
            <div class="hint-step">
              <span class="hint-step-num">2</span>
              <span>Pour afficher avec des variables au milieu d'une phrase, utilise une <strong>f-string</strong> :<br>
              <code>print(f"Bonjour, je m'appelle {prenom}...")</code><br>
              Les <code>{}</code> sont remplacés automatiquement par la valeur de la variable.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion correction" id="corr1">
        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAcc('corr1')">
          ✅ Correction <span class="accordion-icon">▾</span>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <pre><span class="cm"># Variables</span>
prenom <span class="op">=</span> <span class="str">"Alice"</span>
age    <span class="op">=</span> <span class="num">15</span>
classe <span class="op">=</span> <span class="str">"Seconde"</span>

<span class="cm"># Affichage avec f-string</span>
<span class="bi">print</span>(<span class="fn">f</span><span class="str">"Bonjour, je m'appelle {prenom}, j'ai {age} ans et je suis en {classe}."</span>)</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-footer">
      <button class="done-btn" onclick="markDone('c1')">
        <span class="done-icon">○</span> Marquer comme fait
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
     EXO 2 — opérations simples
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="card" id="c2" data-tags="fonction">
  <div class="card-header" onclick="toggle('c2')">
    <div class="card-num" id="num2">02</div>
    <div class="card-title-block">
      <div class="card-title">Calculs de base</div>
      <div class="card-tags">
        <span class="tag tag-fonction">variables</span>
        <span class="tag tag-fonction">opérations</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="card-chevron">▾</span>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">

    <div class="course-block">
      <div class="section-label">📖 Ce qu'il faut savoir</div>
      <div class="course-text">
        <p>Python sait faire des maths ! Les opérateurs de base sont : <code>+</code> <code>-</code> <code>*</code> <code>/</code> pour addition, soustraction, multiplication, division.</p>
        <p>Il y a aussi <code>//</code> pour la division entière et <code>%</code> pour le reste (modulo). Exemple : <code>17 % 5</code> vaut <code>2</code>.</p>
        <p>On peut stocker le résultat d'un calcul : <code>surface = longueur * largeur</code></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exo-content">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">Énoncé</div>
        <p class="consigne">
          On a un rectangle de <strong>longueur 13</strong> et <strong>largeur 7</strong>.<br><br>
          Calcule et affiche :<br>
          — le <strong>périmètre</strong> (2 × (l + L))<br>
          — la <strong>surface</strong> (l × L)<br>
          — la <strong>diagonale</strong> avec <code>diag = (longueur**2 + largeur**2)**0.5</code><br><br>
          <em>Note : <code>**</code> est la puissance. <code>x**0.5</code> calcule la racine carrée.</em>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="expected-box">
        <div class="section-label">Exemple de sortie</div>
        <pre>Périmètre : 40
Surface : 91
Diagonale : 14.76...</pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-wrap">
      <div class="accordion hint" id="h2">
        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAcc('h2')">💡 Indices <span class="accordion-icon">▾</span></div>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <div class="hint-list">
            <div class="hint-step"><span class="hint-step-num">1</span><span>Crée d'abord deux variables : <code>longueur = 13</code> et <code>largeur = 7</code>.</span></div>
            <div class="hint-step"><span class="hint-step-num">2</span><span>Calcule : <code>perimetre = 2 * (longueur + largeur)</code></span></div>
            <div class="hint-step"><span class="hint-step-num">3</span><span>Puis <code>surface = longueur * largeur</code></span></div>
            <div class="hint-step"><span class="hint-step-num">4</span><span>La diagonale : <code>diag = (longueur**2 + largeur**2)**0.5</code></span></div>
            <div class="hint-step"><span class="hint-step-num">5</span><span>Affiche les trois résultats avec <code>print()</code>.</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion correction" id="corr2">
        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAcc('corr2')">✅ Correction <span class="accordion-icon">▾</span></div>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <pre><span class="cm"># Dimensions</span>
longueur <span class="op">=</span> <span class="num">13</span>
largeur  <span class="op">=</span> <span class="num">7</span>

<span class="cm"># Calculs</span>
perimetre <span class="op">=</span> <span class="num">2</span> <span class="op">*</span> (longueur <span class="op">+</span> largeur)
surface   <span class="op">=</span> longueur <span class="op">*</span> largeur
diag      <span class="op">=</span> (longueur<span class="op">**</span><span class="num">2</span> <span class="op">+</span> largeur<span class="op">**</span><span class="num">2</span>)<span class="op">**</span><span class="num">0.5</span>

<span class="bi">print</span>(<span class="fn">f</span><span class="str">"Périmètre : {perimetre}"</span>)
<span class="bi">print</span>(<span class="fn">f</span><span class="str">"Surface : {surface}"</span>)
<span class="bi">print</span>(<span class="fn">f</span><span class="str">"Diagonale : {diag:.2f}"</span>)</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-footer"><button class="done-btn" onclick="markDone('c2')"><span class="done-icon">○</span> Marquer comme fait</button></div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
     EXO 3 — conditions
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="card" id="c3" data-tags="fonction">
  <div class="card-header" onclick="toggle('c3')">
    <div class="card-num" id="num3">03</div>
    <div class="card-title-block">
      <div class="card-title">Pair ou impair ?</div>
      <div class="card-tags">
        <span class="tag tag-fonction">conditions</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="card-chevron">▾</span>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">

    <div class="course-block">
      <div class="section-label">📖 Ce qu'il faut savoir</div>
      <div class="course-text">
        <p>Le <code>if</code> permet d'exécuter du code <strong>seulement si</strong> une condition est vraie. Le <code>else</code> s'exécute si la condition est fausse.</p>
        <p>Structure :</p>
        <p><code>if condition :</code><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>print("c'est vrai")</code><br><code>else :</code><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>print("c'est faux")</code></p>
        <p><strong>Attention :</strong> l'indentation (les espaces au début) est obligatoire en Python !</p>
        <p>L'opérateur <code>%</code> donne le reste d'une division : <code>7 % 2 = 1</code>, <code>8 % 2 = 0</code>. Un nombre est pair si <code>n % 2 == 0</code>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exo-content">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">Énoncé</div>
        <p class="consigne">
          Crée une variable <code>n = 42</code>. Écris un programme qui affiche <strong>"Pair"</strong> si n est pair, <strong>"Impair"</strong> sinon.
          <br><br>Teste ensuite avec <code>n = 17</code> pour vérifier que ça marche dans les deux cas.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="expected-box">
