            <div class="hint-step"><span class="hint-step-num">3</span><span>Dans la boucle : <code>total += i</code></span></div>
            <div class="hint-step"><span class="hint-step-num">4</span><span>Après la boucle (moins indenté) : <code>return total</code></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
